# Walkthrough - DineAI Prompt and Generator Frameworks

We have successfully designed, implemented, and verified the complete **Prompt Engineering Framework** (in [prompts.py](file:///d:/data/AI_WAITER/dine_ai/llm/prompts.py)) and **LLM Generator Framework** (in [generator.py](file:///d:/data/AI_WAITER/dine_ai/llm/generator.py)) for the DineAI platform. Both modules conform strictly to SOLID design principles, Clean Architecture, and Strategy/Factory/Registry patterns.

